  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Pacific Islands, Australian and New Zealand Electoral Administrators (PIANZEA) Network 2021-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide electoral support and advice to the Pacific islands, Australia and New Zealand Electoral Adinistrators Network members, including the Electoral Management Bodies of Papua New Guinea, Fiji, Solomon Islands, Vanuatu, Tonga, Samoa, Federated States of Micronesia, Republic of Marshall Islands, Palau, Kiribati, Nauru, Tuvalu, Tokelau, Niue, and Timor-Leste. Implemented by the Australian Electoral Commission, the investment aims to enhance the capacity of electoral administrators and improve the governance and sustainability of electoral management bodies in the Pacific region.</narrative>
  </description>
